00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:52.200
And even fewer have
comprehensive test coverage,

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:54.570
by which we mean we have
tests that cover every code

00:03:54.570 --> 00:03:56.190
path in our application.

00:03:56.190 --> 00:03:59.040
It's really common for a team
to only run their complete test

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:02.040
suite once a day, maybe less.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:06.970
And that complete test suite
is not all that complete.

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:09.540
So why aren't we testing?

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:12.930
