AUDIENCE: Strawberry.

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:55.430
DAVE STANKE: Oh yeah,
that's a strawberry.

00:12:55.430 --> 00:13:02.080
And TensorFlow thinks--
strawberry, 99.98% confidence.

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:03.760
All right, it's working.

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:05.780
I'm going to make a change
to this application.

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:07.420
So I'm going to go
into the Java code

00:13:07.420 --> 00:13:16.390
here, and do a vim, source,
main, Java, and then myself.

00:13:16.390 --> 00:13:19.780
And then there's a
greeter class in here.

00:13:19.780 --> 00:13:20.930
Oh, look what I've done.

00:13:24.192 --> 00:13:27.150
All right, we got a
