00:13:42.291 --> 00:13:42.790
There we go.

00:13:46.600 --> 00:13:48.970
Oh my gosh.

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:50.780
Vim.

00:13:50.780 --> 00:13:52.980
All right, did that work?

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:54.672
Yes, OK.

00:13:54.672 --> 00:13:56.880
All right, and then we're
going to go ahead and rerun

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:58.260
